  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Cut pumpkin into thin wedges.\n• Slice zucchini into half-moons.\n• Cut beetroot into 1cm chunks. TIP: Peel the pumpkin if you prefer!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6874d6a0c30d33981f9979c5/step-e3391e00.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Place pumpkin on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, sprinkle with garlic & herb seasoning and toss to coat.\n• Place beetroot and zucchini on a second lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, season with salt and pepper and toss to coat. Roast pumpkin and veggies until tender, 25-30 minutes. Allow veggies to cool slightly.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6874d6a0c30d33981f9979c5/step-83fa6f10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Cut or tear bake-at-home ciabatta into bite-sized chunks.\n• In a medium bowl, combine ciabatta chunks, savoury seasoning and a good drizzle of olive oil.\n• In the last 7 minutes of cook time, place ciabatta on the roast veggie tray. Bake until golden, 5-7 minutes.\n• Meanwhile, in a small bowl, combine marinated goat cheese and Greek-style yoghurt and stir to combine. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6874d6a0c30d33981f9979c5/step-1201d820.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• When veggies and croutons have cooled slightly, add mixed salad leaves and balsamic vinaigrette dressing to the beetroot and zucchini tray. Toss to coat.\n• Divide salad between bowls, then top with garlicky pumpkin.\n• Spoon over goat cheese yoghurt. Sprinkle with flaked almonds to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6874d6a0c30d33981f9979c5/step-c1a28f30.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
